    "sub_name": "電子學",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹基礎電子學原理、電子元件特性和基本電子電路分析。課程包括半導體電子元件的特性與操作應用講授，含半導體物理概論、二極體、雙載子電晶體、場效電晶體、和運算放大器。",
    "describe_eh": "The course is design to introduce fundamental principle of electronics, electronic device's characteristics, and electronic circuit analysis. Students will engage in the study of basic concepts including basic semiconductor physics, electronic device models such as diodes, bipolar junction transistors, field effect transistors, and operational amplifiers, . A student fulfills the course requirements who will have demonstrated a familiarity with basic electrical characteristics of common semiconductor devices and DC bias analysis.",
